  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Odb 100 OIL FUND DISBURSEMENT BOARD\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 541-A:16, I(a)\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #5534, effective 12-21-92, made extensive changes to the wording, structure, and numbering of rules in Chapter Odb 100. Document #5534 supersedes all prior filings for the sections in this chapter. The prior filings for former Chapter Odb 100 include the following documents:\n\n#4759, eff 2-13-90\n\n#5115, eff 4-16-91",
